#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:1
msgid "`cnetml`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:3
msgid ""
"`cnetml` builds phylogenetic trees from copy-number profiles by maximum "
"likelihood, jointly inferring tree topology, node ages, and mutation rates "
"from (optionally longitudinal) samples of a single patient."
msgstr "`cnetml` 用最大似然法从拷贝数谱构建系统发育树，从单个患者的样本（可以是纵向多时间点样本）中联合推断树拓扑、节点年龄和突变速率。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:7
msgid ""
"Overview of the cnetml2 workflow, from longitudinal sampling to copy number "
"profiles to evolutionary inference"
msgstr "cnetml2 工作流程概览：从纵向采样到拷贝数谱，再到演化推断"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:16
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:17
msgid ""
"Mature and published — see [Lu et al., Genome Biology "
"2023](https://doi.org/10.1186/s13059-023-02983-0)."
msgstr ""
"成熟、已发表，见 [Lu et al., Genome Biology "
"2023](https://doi.org/10.1186/s13059-023-02983-0)。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:20
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:25
msgid ""
"`bin/run-cnetml.sh` is the maintained example driver, parameterised by a "
"`mode` variable at the top of the script."
msgstr "`bin/run-cnetml.sh` 是持续维护的示例运行脚本，用脚本顶部的 `mode` 变量选择运行模式。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:28
msgid "Modes (`mode`)"
msgstr "运行模式（`mode`）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:29
msgid ""
"`0` (default) — Infer the maximum-likelihood tree from input copy numbers. "
"Add `-b 1` to bootstrap."
msgstr "`0`（默认）：从输入拷贝数推断最大似然树。加 `-b 1` 做 bootstrap。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:31
msgid "`1` — Simple comprehensive test on a simulated tree."
msgstr "`1`：在模拟树上做简单的综合测试。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:32
msgid "`2` — Compute the likelihood of a given tree and parameters."
msgstr "`2`：计算给定树和参数的似然。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:33
msgid ""
"`3` — Optimize branch lengths (and rates) for a given topology. Add `-b 1` "
"to bootstrap."
msgstr "`3`：给定拓扑，优化枝长（和速率）。加 `-b 1` 做 bootstrap。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:35
msgid "`4` — Infer marginal and joint ancestral states for a given tree."
msgstr "`4`：推断给定树的边际和联合祖先状态。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:37
msgid ""
"Modes 1-3 are mainly used to validate the likelihood computation, per the "
"original README."
msgstr "据原 README，模式 1-3 主要用于验证似然计算。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:40
msgid "Options"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:41
msgid ""
"Grouped by purpose; see `run-cnetml.sh` for the full set with example "
"values, and the [options reference](../configuration/options.md#cnetml-"
"maximum-likelihood-inference) for every option with its default and accepted"
" values."
msgstr ""
"按用途分组；完整参数及示例值见 `run-"
"cnetml.sh`，每个参数的默认值和可选值见[参数参考](../configuration/options.md#cnetml-maximum-"
"likelihood-inference)。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:45
msgid "Time constraints"
msgstr "时间约束"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:46
msgid "`--constrained`/`cons` — optimize under patient-age/tip-timing constraints."
msgstr "`--constrained`/`cons`：在患者年龄和 tip 采样时间的约束下优化。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:48
msgid ""
"`--estmu` — estimate mutation rates. Only reliable with informative tip-"
"timing, i.e. `cons=1` and non-zero time differences between tips."
msgstr "`--estmu`：估计突变速率。只有 tip 采样时间提供足够信息时才可靠，即 `cons=1` 且各 tip 之间的时间差不为零。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:51
msgid "Model (`--model`/`-d`)"
msgstr "模型（`--model`/`-d`）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:52
msgid "`0` — Mk, deprecated."
msgstr "`0`：Mk，已弃用。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:53
msgid "`1` — bounded total copy number, deprecated."
msgstr "`1`：bounded total copy number，已弃用。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:54
msgid "`2` — bounded haplotype-specific copy number."
msgstr "`2`：bounded haplotype-specific copy number。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:55
msgid ""
"`3` — independent Markov chain, recommended for data with chromosome "
"gain/loss and WGD. Differs from the model typically used to *simulate* such "
"data in `cnets` (usually model 2). Model 2 can also be used for "
"reconstruction, but assumes a strict event order: WGD, then chromosomal "
"gain/loss, then duplication/deletion."
msgstr ""
"`3`：independent Markov chain，数据含染色体 gain/loss 和 WGD 时推荐使用。它和 `cnets` "
"中通常用来*模拟*这类数据的模型（一般是 model 2）不同。Model 2 也可以用于重建，但假设事件严格按顺序发生：先 WGD，再染色体 "
"gain/loss，最后 duplication/deletion。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:61
msgid "Independent Markov chain dimensions (model 3 only)"
msgstr "Independent Markov chain 的维度（仅 model 3）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:62
msgid "`max_wgd` — at most 1; simulations allow at most one WGD per sample."
msgstr "`max_wgd`：最多为 1；模拟中每个样本最多一次 WGD。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:64
msgid ""
"`max_chr_change` — usually 1, higher only if some chromosomes undergo more "
"than one gain/loss event."
msgstr "`max_chr_change`：通常为 1；只有某些染色体发生多于一次 gain/loss 时才需要更大。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:66
msgid ""
"`max_site_change` — often >1, since site-level CNAs frequently overlap, e.g."
" with no WGD/chromosome events and a maximum copy number of 5, use "
"`max_site_change = 3`."
msgstr ""
"`max_site_change`：常常大于 1，因为 site 级 CNA 经常重叠。例如没有 WGD 和染色体级事件、最大拷贝数为 5 时，用 "
"`max_site_change = 3`。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:69
msgid "`m_max` — maximum segment copies before chromosome-level events."
msgstr "`m_max`：染色体级事件之前 segment 的最大拷贝数。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:71
msgid ""
"Setting these too low gives an incorrect likelihood; too high slows "
"computation. Use `Rscript util/check_site_pattern.R -c sim1-cn.txt -t "
"sim1-patterns.txt` to help pick values for real data."
msgstr ""
"设得太小似然不正确，太大计算慢。真实数据可以用 `Rscript util/check_site_pattern.R -c sim1-cn.txt -t"
" sim1-patterns.txt` 帮助选取取值。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:76
msgid "Tree search (`tree_search`)"
msgstr "树搜索（`tree_search`）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:77
msgid "`0` — genetic algorithm. Slow, deprecated."
msgstr "`0`：遗传算法。慢，已弃用。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:78
msgid "`1` — heuristic/hill-climbing. For at least 5 samples."
msgstr "`1`：启发式爬山搜索。适用于至少 5 个样本。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:79
msgid "`2` — exhaustive. Efficient for up to 7 samples."
msgstr "`2`：穷举。最多 7 个样本时高效。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:81
msgid "Mutation types (`cn_type`)"
msgstr "突变类型（`cn_type`）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:82
msgid "`0` — segment only."
msgstr "`0`：仅 segment 级。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:83
msgid "`1` — chromosome+WGD."
msgstr "`1`：染色体级 + WGD。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:84
msgid "`2` — segment+WGD."
msgstr "`2`：segment 级 + WGD。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:85
msgid "`3` — segment+chromosome."
msgstr "`3`：segment 级 + 染色体级。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:86
msgid "`4` — all."
msgstr "`4`：全部。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:88
msgid ""
"Which rate categories to estimate. This flag is specific to "
"`cnetml`/`cnetmcmc` — `cnets` has no `cn_type` selector; it turns event "
"types on/off by zeroing the corresponding rate flag instead (see [`cnets` "
"options](cnets.md#options))."
msgstr ""
"选择估计哪些类别的速率。这个参数只有 `cnetml`/`cnetmcmc` 有；`cnets` 没有 "
"`cn_type`，而是通过把对应速率参数设为零来关闭某类事件（见 [`cnets` 参数](cnets.md#options)）。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:93
msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:94
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必需"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:95
msgid ""
"A copy-number file (`*-cn.txt.gz` or `*-haplotype-cn.txt.gz`), space "
"separated, **no header row**: `sample_ID chr_ID site_ID CN` for total copy "
"number, or with an extra `cnA cnB` for haplotype-specific. `sample_ID` must "
"be ordered from 1 to the number of patient samples."
msgstr ""
"拷贝数文件（`*-cn.txt.gz` 或 `*-haplotype-cn.txt.gz`），空格分隔，**没有表头行**：总拷贝数为 "
"`sample_ID chr_ID site_ID CN`，haplotype-specific 拷贝数再多 `cnA cnB` "
"两列。`sample_ID` 必须从 1 编号到患者样本数。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:100
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "可选"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:101
msgid ""
"A sample-timing file (`*-rel-times.txt`); a directory of initial trees for "
"tree search (recommended for large trees, to avoid local optima)."
msgstr "样本时间文件（`*-rel-times.txt`）；树搜索用的初始树目录（大树推荐使用，减少陷入局部最优）。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:104
msgid "See [File formats](../file-formats/index.md) for full column definitions."
msgstr "各列的完整定义见[文件格式](../file-formats/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:107
msgid ""
"\"Please ensure the input file exists and its name is correct, or else there"
" may be an error of 'Segmentation fault (core dumped)'\" — from the original"
" README."
msgstr "\"请确认输入文件存在且文件名正确，否则可能出现 'Segmentation fault (core dumped)' 错误。\"（摘自原 README）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:112
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:114
msgid ""
"The original README (and earlier versions of this page) described these as "
"`*-tree.txt` / `*-tree.nex` / `*-tree.nmut.nex`. That's not what the code "
"does: there is no hardcoded `-tree` suffix. All of the files below are "
"`<ofile>` plus a fixed extension, where `<ofile>` is whatever you pass to "
"`-o`/`--ofile` (default `maxL-tree.txt`; `run-cnetml.sh` sets it to "
"`MaxL-<suffix>.txt`). See [File formats](../file-formats/index.md) for the "
"verified naming."
msgstr ""
"原 README（以及本页早期版本）把这些文件写成 `*-tree.txt` / `*-tree.nex` / "
"`*-tree.nmut.nex`，但代码并不是这样：代码里没有固定的 `-tree` 后缀。下面所有文件名都是 `<ofile>` "
"加固定扩展名，`<ofile>` 就是传给 `-o`/`--ofile` 的值（默认 `maxL-tree.txt`；`run-cnetml.sh` "
"设为 `MaxL-<suffix>.txt`）。经核实的命名见[文件格式](../file-formats/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:123
msgid ""
"`<ofile>` / `<ofile>.nex` (reconstructed tree, calendar-time branch "
"lengths), `<ofile>.nmut.nex` (branch lengths in mutation counts), "
"`<ofile>.summary.txt` (run metadata: mode, model, `bsr_mode`, likelihood, "
"mutation-rate estimates), `<ofile>.edge_rates.txt` (per-branch rate and "
"expected/observed mutation-count breakdown — only meaningful with `bsr_mode "
"> 0`), `*-segs.txt` (postprocessed copy-number matrix, written when reading "
"the input file, named by `--seg_file`)."
msgstr ""
"`<ofile>` / "
"`<ofile>.nex`（重建的树，枝长为日历时间），`<ofile>.nmut.nex`（枝长为突变数），`<ofile>.summary.txt`（运行信息：mode、model、`bsr_mode`、似然、突变速率估计），`<ofile>.edge_rates.txt`（各分支速率及期望/观测突变数明细，只在"
" `bsr_mode > 0` 时有意义），`*-segs.txt`（预处理后的拷贝数矩阵，读取输入文件时写出，文件名由 `--seg_file` "
"指定）。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetml.md:131
msgid ""
"Ancestral-state mode (`mode=4`) additionally writes `<ofile>.mrca.cn` / "
"`<ofile>.joint.cn` and `<ofile>.mrca.state` / `<ofile>.joint.state` for "
"models 0-2. Model 3 (independent Markov chains) splits the MRCA state file "
"by event type instead — `<ofile>.mrca.seg.state` / `.mrca.chr.state` / "
"`.mrca.wgd.state` — while the joint state file stays a single "
"`<ofile>.joint.state`. See [File formats](../file-formats/index.md) for "
"column definitions."
msgstr ""
"祖先状态模式（`mode=4`）在 model 0-2 下还会写出 `<ofile>.mrca.cn` / `<ofile>.joint.cn` 和 "
"`<ofile>.mrca.state` / `<ofile>.joint.state`。Model 3（independent Markov "
"chains）则把 MRCA 状态文件按事件类型拆分为 `<ofile>.mrca.seg.state` / `.mrca.chr.state` / "
"`.mrca.wgd.state`，联合状态文件仍是一个 `<ofile>.joint.state`。各列定义见[文件格式](../file-"
"formats/index.md)。"

